<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Weekly Salary Credited</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    background:#0B0E11;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    padding:40px 15px;
    color:#EAECEF;
}

.wrapper{
    max-width:560px;
    margin:auto;
}

.logo{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:24px;
}

.logo span{
    color:#FCD535;
    font-size:24px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.5px;
}

.card{

    background:#181A20;
    border:1px solid #2B3139;
    border-radius:16px;
    overflow:hidden;

}

/* Header */

.header{

    padding:45px 35px;
    text-align:center;
    border-bottom:1px solid #2B3139;

}

.icon{

    width:74px;
    height:74px;
    margin:auto;
    margin-bottom:22px;

    background:#FCD535;
    border-radius:50%;

    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;

}

.icon svg{

    width:34px;
    height:34px;
    stroke:#111;

}

.header h1{

    font-size:28px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    color:#fff;

}

.header p{

    color:#848E9C;
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:24px;

}


/* Body */

.content{

    padding:35px;

}

.greeting{

    color:#B7BDC6;
    line-height:28px;
    font-size:15px;
    margin-bottom:30px;

}

.greeting strong{

    color:#fff;

}


/* Amount */

.amount{

    background:#0B0E11;
    border:1px solid #2B3139;
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px;
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:32px;

}

.amount small{

    display:block;
    color:#848E9C;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    margin-bottom:10px;

}

.amount h2{

    font-size:42px;
    color:#FCD535;
    font-weight:700;

}

.amount h2 span{

    font-size:18px;
    color:#848E9C;
    margin-left:6px;

}


/* Details */

.details{

    border:1px solid #2B3139;
    border-radius:12px;
    overflow:hidden;

}

.row{

    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;

    padding:18px 20px;

    border-bottom:1px solid #2B3139;

}

.row:last-child{

    border-bottom:none;

}

.label{

    color:#848E9C;
    font-size:13px;

}

.value{

    color:#fff;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:14px;

}

.status{

    color:#0ECB81;

}


/* Note */

.note{

    margin-top:28px;
    background:#0B0E11;
    border-left:4px solid #FCD535;
    padding:18px;
    color:#B7BDC6;
    line-height:26px;
    border-radius:8px;

}

/* Footer */

.footer{

    text-align:center;
    margin-top:35px;
    border-top:1px solid #2B3139;
    padding-top:28px;

}

.footer strong{

    color:#FCD535;

}

.footer p{

    color:#848E9C;
    line-height:26px;
    font-size:14px;

}

.copyright{

    margin-top:28px;
    color:#5E6673;
    font-size:12px;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="wrapper">

<div class="logo">
<span>Phoenix Capital</span>
</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="header">

<div class="icon">

<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
<polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
</svg>

</div>

<h1>Weekly Salary Credited</h1>

<p>
Your referral program weekly salary has been successfully credited.
</p>

</div>

<div class="content">

<p class="greeting">

Hello <strong>{{ user.fullName || 'User' }}</strong>,<br><br>

Congratulations! Your weekly referral salary has been processed successfully and is now available in your wallet.

</p>

<div class="amount">

<small>Weekly Salary</small>

<h2>{{ amount }} <span>USDT</span></h2>

</div>

<div class="details">

<div class="row">

<span class="label">
Reward Type
</span>

<span class="value">
Weekly Referral Salary
</span>

</div>

<div class="row">

<span class="label">
Referral Level
</span>

<span class="value">
{{ levelName }} (Level {{ level }})
</span>

</div>

<div class="row">

<span class="label">
Status
</span>

<span class="value status">
Completed
</span>

</div>

</div>

<div class="note">

Your reward has already been added to your wallet balance. Continue inviting friends and grow your network to unlock higher referral levels and increase your weekly earnings.

</div>

<div class="footer">

<p>
Thank you for choosing <strong>Phoenix Capital</strong>.
</p>

<p>
This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
</p>

<p class="copyright">
© 2026 Phoenix Capital. All rights reserved.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>